    "detail": {
      "id": 1320702,
      "name": "[Ellen] Dangerous Bearings",
      "desc": "When <color=#FFFFFF>Roaming</color>, Ellen gains 2 <color=#FFFFFF>Flash Freeze Charge</color> and <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Charge</color> every 0.5 sec. When Ellen hits an enemy with Swift Scissors or Charged Scissor Strike during <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Arctic Ambush</color>, she <color=#2BAD00>leaves an Icy Mist on the ground</color>, which deals <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG over time</color> to enemies and <color=#98EFF0>reduces their Ice RES</color> by 30% for 10s. Ellen's <color=#2BAD00>Anti-Interrupt level increases</color> and she <color=#2BAD00>gains 50% DMG reduction</color> while in the <color=#FFFFFF>Icy Mist</color>. This effect continues for 5s after leaving the <color=#FFFFFF>Icy Mist</color>.",
